   "html": "<p class=\"source-heading\" id=\"section-doc02-32\"><span>三、</span><strong>合作共赢</strong><span>原则p44</span></p><p><span>坚持合作共赢原则的基本要求：</span><span></span></p><ol><li><p class=\"source-heading\" id=\"section-doc02-33\"><span>（一）</span><span>树立诚信意识p45（二）讲究沟通技巧p46</span><span></span><span></span> </p></li></ol><p class=\"source-heading\" id=\"section-doc02-34\"><span>（三）营造合作氛围p47（四）奖励及时兑现p47</span><span></span></p>",
