   "mainId": "doc02",
   "anchor": "section-doc02-38",
   "html": "<ol><li><p class=\"source-heading\" id=\"section-doc02-38\"><span>五、</span><strong>全警公关</strong><span>原则p51</span><span></span> </p></li></ol><ol><li><p class=\"source-heading\" id=\"section-doc02-39\"><span>（一）</span><span>注重整体意识p51（二）上下齐心协力p52</span><span></span><span></span> </p></li><li><p class=\"source-heading\" id=\"section-doc02-40\"><span>（二）</span><span>完善沟通机制p53（四）妥善处理危机p53</span><span></span><span></span> </p></li></ol><ol><li><h1><span>第四章</span><a id=\"a_第四章_警察公共关系的职能p55\"><span>警察公共关系的</span><span>职能</span><span>p55</span></a><span></span> </h1></li></ol><p><strong>警察公共关系的基本职能：（5个）</strong><strong></strong></p>",
